# Google Drive Integration Settings
# 1. Create a project at https://console.cloud.google.com/
# 2. Enable the "Google Drive API"
# 3. Configure the "OAuth consent screen" (External user type, add yourself as a test user)
# 4. Create an "OAuth client ID" (Application type: Web application)
# 5. Add "http://localhost:5173" to "Authorized JavaScript origins"
# 6. Copy the Client ID below:

VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id_here
